                <div class="modal-body">
                  <div class="row">
                    <!-- Left column: fixed -->
                    <div class="col-md-4 d-none d-md-flex flex-column align-items-start modal-col-sticky">
                      <img src="/images/pancho.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded mt-3" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="José Francisco Berdaguer - Lawyer">
                    </div>
                    <!-- Right column: scroll -->
                    <div class="col-md-8 col-12 p-1">
                      <h2 class="fw-bold pt-2" id="modalBerdaguerLabel">José Francisco Berdaguer</h2>
                      <h4 class="fw-bold pb-3">Lawyer | Specialist in Contracts</h4>
                      <p>Lawyer and notary graduated from the Catholic University of Córdoba (1995 and 1996), and Master in Business Law from Universidad Austral (1998).</p>
                      <p>With over 25 years of experience in business and commercial law, he specializes in drafting and negotiating complex contracts, structuring commercial operations, and providing legal advice to national and international companies.</p>
                      <p>He actively participated in the launch and commercialization of DIRECTV in Argentina and Uruguay, as well as in the organization and sale of sports broadcasting rights for TyC Sports, building an outstanding career in entertainment and audiovisual law.</p>
                      <p>His practice includes comprehensive advice on large-scale commercial contracts—such as agency, concession, and distribution agreements—as well as legal support for startups and digital business projects related to new technologies.</p>
                      <p>He is also legal counsel for CECHA (Confederation of Fuel Trade Entities of Argentina) and provincial associations of service stations across the country.</p>
                      <p>Member of the Buenos Aires Bar Association, he combines a technical and strategic approach with a solid understanding of the Argentine business environment.</p>
                      <p class="modal-contact-item mb-1"><i class="bi bi-translate"></i><span class="visually-hidden">Languages: </span>Spanish, English</p>
                      <p class="modal-contact-item"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i><span class="visually-hidden">Email: </span><a href="mailto:fberdaguer@brvscu.com.ar">fberdaguer@brvscu.com.ar</a></p>
                      <p class="modal-contact-item"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/francisco-berdaguer-149949112/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

