                      <p>He is the author of articles on contract and insolvency law and a regular speaker at legal conferences.</p>
                      <p>His practice includes drafting and negotiating complex commercial contracts, corporate restructuring, share transfers, and designing efficient legal structures for companies, real estate developments, and family businesses.</p>
                      <p>He represents shopping centers, supermarket chains, construction companies, insurers, banks, and restaurants, among other sectors.</p>
                      <p>He also participates in civil and commercial litigation, assisting clients with a strategic focus on conflict prevention and business sustainability.</p>
                      <p>He has worked at the National Civil Courts, the Government Control Agency, and various leading business law firms.</p>
                      <p>Member of the Argentine Institute of Commercial Law (IADC), the Argentine Entrepreneurs Association (ASEA), and the Bar Associations of Buenos Aires and San Isidro.</p>
                      <p class="modal-contact-item mb-1"><i class="bi bi-translate"></i><span class="visually-hidden">Languages: </span>Spanish, English</p>
